            },
            "note": {
              "5": [
                "If the person is born abroad and country of birth is unknown for both parents, both the parents are assumed to be born abroad. However, if the person is adopted and none of the parents has been resident in Sweden, from 2004 on, the person is classified as having at least one parent born in Sweden if at least one of the adoptive parents is born in Sweden. This change explains the increase in the number of foreign born with at least one of the parents born in Sweden between 2003 and 2004."
